; tests/graph-node-mutation-memory-carrier-band.fk -- mutable graph nodes over memory.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk form-stdlib/storage-port.fk form-stdlib/graph-node-port.fk
;
; The MEMORY carrier band holds only the memory door. cell-log-store.fk and
; storage-port-file.fk were preluded here and called from nowhere in this chain
; (no cls- name, no carrier-file/file-put/file-get name appears in storage-port.fk,
; graph-node-port.fk, or this band) — the file carrier has its own band. Their one
; cost was real: cell-log-store's cls-open-with names record_new, which is native on
; go/rust/ts and ABSENT on fkwu, so the fourth arm answered 1 with exit 1 over a door
; this band never opens. Dropping a dead prelude, same repair as cache-binary.fk.
;
(do
    (let verdict (gn-mutation-test (carrier-memory) ""))
    (if (eq verdict 1111111) 1 0))
